== diags.diag/statement-attribute
BYN1069 2:5 attribute `@inline` is not allowed before a statement
  label before a statement
  help remove the attribute; only `@unobservable` may come before a statement
BYN1069 9:5 attribute `@allow` is not allowed before a statement
  label before a statement
  help remove the attribute; only `@unobservable` may come before a statement
